  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 100,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Chat API Operator Guide",
      "description": "Action guide for chat and streaming. No Data means check Gateway scrape and live stream traffic.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 5
      },
      "targets": [],
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## Chat API와 streaming을 보는 법 / Chat API runbook\n- 먼저 request rate, p95/p99 latency, 5xx rate를 확인합니다.\n- `stream=true`는 chunk rate, byte throughput, error, usage event metric으로 relay 상태를 봅니다.\n- TTFT p95는 `Streaming Time to First Token p95`, stream duration p95는 `Streaming Duration p95`, chunks per response p95는 `Chunks per Response p95` panel에서 확인합니다.\n- Gateway path와 upstream path 중 어디가 병목인지는 `Gateway vs Upstream p95` panel로 비교합니다.\n- No Data는 Gateway `/metrics` scrape와 streaming code path가 실제로 실행됐는지 확인합니다.\n- prompt/user text/model output은 절대 metric label로 노출되지 않습니다.\n"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Chat Request Rate",
      "description": "Healthy/정상: expected range. Attention/주의: review trend. Action Required/조치 필요: investigate owner/runbook. No Data/런타임 데이터 없음: check Prometheus scrape/exporter.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(http_requests_total{service=\"gateway\",route=\"/v1/chat/completions\"}[$window]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "rps"
        }
      ],
      "options": {},
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "decimals": 2
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Chat p95 Latency",
      "description": "Healthy/정상: expected range. Attention/주의: review trend. Action Required/조치 필요: investigate owner/runbook. No Data/런타임 데이터 없음: check Prometheus scrape/exporter.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 4,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(http_request_duration_seconds_bucket{service=\"gateway\",route=\"/v1/chat/completions\"}[$window])) by (le))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "p95"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "decimals": 3,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 5.0
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 10.0
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Chat p99 Latency",
      "description": "Healthy/정상: expected range. Attention/주의: review trend. Action Required/조치 필요: investigate owner/runbook. No Data/런타임 데이터 없음: check Prometheus scrape/exporter.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 8,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum(rate(http_request_duration_seconds_bucket{service=\"gateway\",route=\"/v1/chat/completions\"}[$window])) by (le))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "p99"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "decimals": 3,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 5.0
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 10.0
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Chat 5xx Rate",
      "description": "Healthy/정상: expected range. Attention/주의: review trend. Action Required/조치 필요: investigate owner/runbook. No Data/런타임 데이터 없음: check Prometheus scrape/exporter.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(increase(http_requests_total{service=\"gateway\",route=\"/v1/chat/completions\",status_code=~\"5..\"}[$window])) / clamp_min(sum(increase(http_requests_total{service=\"gateway\",route=\"/v1/chat/completions\"}[$window])), 1)",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "5xx ratio"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "decimals": 2,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 0.01
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.05
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
